msgid "The ``closed`` Class Parameter"
msgstr ""

#: ../../peps/peps/pep-0728.rst:240
msgid ""
"When ``closed=True`` is set, no extra items are allowed. This is a shorthand "
"for ``extra_items=Never``, because there can't be a value type that is "
"assignable to :class:`~typing.Never`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../peps/peps/pep-0728.rst:244
msgid ""
"Similar to ``total``, only a literal ``True`` or ``False`` is supported as "
