#: ../../peps/peps/pep-0728.rst:290
msgid "Interaction with Totality"
msgstr ""

#: ../../peps/peps/pep-0728.rst:292
msgid ""
"It is an error to use ``Required[]`` or ``NotRequired[]`` with "
